# Cloudflare Pages/Workers headers.
# No build step = no hashed filenames, so code/data get short browser caching
# (the edge cache self-invalidates on each atomic deployment).
#
# img-src allows *.wikimedia.org as a wildcard rather than named hosts, and that
# is deliberate. Historic flags, US/Mexican/Canadian state flags and the religious
# symbols are all requested from commons.wikimedia.org's Special:FilePath
# endpoint, which 301s to whichever host is currently serving the bytes. That was
# upload.wikimedia.org; thumbnails now come from thumb.wikimedia.org instead, and
# because a CSP is enforced against the redirect TARGET, naming the hosts one by
# one silently broke every one of those images in production the day Wikimedia
# moved them -- with nothing failing in CI, because the dev server sends no CSP.
# The wildcard covers the next move too. It is one foundation's image hosts, and
# images cannot execute.
#
# connect-src carries the same hosts, and must. It looks like it should not:
# these images are only ever <img src>, and img-src is what governs those. But
# sw.js intercepts every request to a CACHE_FIRST_HOST and re-issues it as
# fetch() -- and a fetch() made by a service worker is governed by connect-src,
# under the CSP this same file serves to sw.js. So with img-src fixed and
# connect-src left alone, the browser allowed the image and the worker was then
# refused the network, which surfaces as a bare net::ERR_FAILED with no CSP
# report to explain it. Both directives have to list the host, or neither works.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; img-src 'self' https://flagcdn.com https://*.wikimedia.org https://*.clarity.ms; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; style-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://www.clarity.ms https://scripts.clarity.ms; connect-src 'self' https://*.clarity.ms https://flagcdn.com https://*.wikimedia.org; worker-src 'self'

/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
